  "description": "<p>There is a class DefaultSerializer, in the REST api. It's job is to convert fedora datastructures to xml and html return values for the REST api. It does this by initializing a stringbuffer and appending strings as it parse the datastructure. This procedure works, but should be improved to some sort of automatic conversion or generation.</p>",
